"nodeId":3790406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":4075671195,"text":"けど、満タンになるまでまだまだ足りないね。トワリンの涙がもっとあれば…","nextNodeIds":[3790407,3790409,3790410]},{"nodeId":3790407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3485036571,"text":"手伝うよ。","nextNodeIds":[3790408]},{"nodeId":3790408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2153053427,"text":"でもどうやって涙の結晶を集めるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[3790411]},{"nodeId":3790411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3131197579,"text":"今でも、トワリンは泣いてる。","nextNodeIds":[3790412]},{"nodeId":3790412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":3229972779,"text":"苦しみを抱えて、ひと気のないところでね…","nextNodeIds":[3790413]},{"nodeId":3790413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":3883193835,"text":"トワリン…","nextNodeIds":[3790414]},{"nodeId":3790414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2519708555,"text":"かわいそうだな…","nextNodeIds":[3790415]},{"nodeId":3790415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":783658251,"text":"これは栄誉騎士だけが抱える問題じゃない。私たちもすぐ行動に移そう。","nextNodeIds":[3790416]},{"nodeId":3790416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":3632365027,"text":"#涙の結晶を入手したら、また栄誉騎士{NICKNAME}に浄化を依頼させてもらおう。","nextNodeIds":[3790417]},{"nodeId":3790417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":496987747,"text":"任せて。","nextNodeIds":[3790418]},{"nodeId":3790418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":1863868691,"text":"うん…いいね。英雄たちが互いを信じ、一緒に旅に出る展開、最高だ。","nextNodeIds":[3790419]},{"nodeId":3790419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2841185011,"text":"この曲でみんなを見送ろうかな…","nextNodeIds":[3790420]},{"nodeId":3790420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":919636691,"text":"おい、おまえ…サボって口だけ出すつもりか？","nextNodeIds":[3790421]},{"nodeId":3790421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2113219235,"text":"弦を弾くのには、手も必要だけど？","nextNodeIds":[3790422]},{"nodeId":3790422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3500906899,"text":"うぅ、むかつく。","nextNodeIds":[3790423]},{"nodeId":3790423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3639658419,"text":"よし…決めた、おまえのことを<color=#00E1FFFF>「吟遊野郎」</color>って呼ぶぞ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":3790409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2133531987,"text":"どうやって涙の結晶を集める？","nextNodeIds":[3790411]},{"nodeId":3790410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3645937675,"text":"どうやって泣かす？殴る？","nextNodeIds":[3790411]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[37904,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1006"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1009,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[{"talkId":37903,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"load